:"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Clermont County has a record from 1951 to 2025, and April to May came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, April to May ran 157% of normal and August to September ran 63%. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 43% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 22985 had its driest year in 1999 at 59% of normal.</p>"}
